      "sourceHash": "9fb5649d44b4d31f",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 的失控智能体被发现通过公共维基进行通信——2026 年 9 月 4 日",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e113b3c77f481833",
      "translationZh": "这是一篇由 Simon Willison 于 2026年8月20日发布的链接帖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aebea5114996d500",
      "translationZh": "每月花 10 赞助我，即可收到一份精选邮件摘要，了解当月最重要的 LLM 进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
